"2017-04-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Pathe News sketches for Jack FM"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>I love being asked to voice in the old Pathe voice style. It's rather spiffing I say.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Keeping the history alive</h2>\r\n<p>I love doing this classic voice. The Pathé voice is part of my repertoire that I love to showcase and I'm also addicted to the Pathé YouTube channel. I can get lost watching endless videos on there. As you'll see on my <a href=\"/pathe-news-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pathe Voicé\">Pathé voice page</a>, I have a lot of experience with this particular voiceover style, so please feel free to get in touch if you'd like my <a href=\"/https://www.pathevoice.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Pathé News Voiceover\">Pathé News Voiceover</a> for your next project!</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/assets/audio/pathe-news-voice-pub-visit-guy-harris.mp3","title":"Pathe News sketches for Jack FM"}]}],false]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/pathe-news-jack-fm.jpg","alt":"pathe-news-jack-fm","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>History of Pathe</h2>\r\n<p>Before television, people came to movie theatres to watch the news. British Pathé was at the forefront of cinematic journalism, blending information with entertainment to popular effect. Over the course of a century, it documented everything from major armed conflicts and seismic political crises to the curious hobbies and eccentric lives of ordinary people. If it happened, British Pathé filmed it. I find this style fascinating and it's a fun voice for any voiceover artist to do, so I was really pleased when Jack FM asked me to do it. Jack FM is a radio station based in Oxfordshire and they were a pleasure to work with on this job.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>If this be up your street, get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you are looking for a style similar to this Pathe News piece, do please <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"get in touch\">get in touch</a>. I'll gladly send you a sample first to see if my voice is right for your promo or brand. If you're not looking for a Pathe news style, one of my other <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial\">commercial</a> or <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Character Voiceovers\">character voiceovers</a> might be right for your project!</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L5",null,{"pageTitle":"Pathe News sketches for Jack FM","pageUrl":"pathe-news-jack-fm"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L4","558",{"href":"/pathe-news-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/pathe-news-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Pathe News Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Pathe News Voiceover"}]]}]